{
  "id": "c1-e50-deep-reading",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Deep reading",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you read for pleasure?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how has your reading changed since you were younger?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you find it easy to concentrate on a long text?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what book has had the greatest influence on you?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e50-a1",
            "c1-e50-a2",
            "c1-e50-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people dealing with reading. Choose two of the pictures and say how well the people might be concentrating, and what they might get out of reading in this way.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways of reading is closest to your own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e50-b1",
            "c1-e50-b2",
            "c1-e50-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people enjoying books. Choose two of the pictures and say why books might be important to these people, and how reading experiences might differ.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, why do you think some people never read for pleasure?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to encourage deeper reading, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e50-deep-reading",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these ideas help people to read more deeply?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e50-deep-reading",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most successful?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about reading and concentration.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is the ability to read long texts under threat in the digital age?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent do you think reading fiction makes people more understanding of others?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, will books on paper eventually disappear?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Does summarising information online make us less able to think deeply?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should schools set aside time for reading every day?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is it better to read widely or to read a few books in depth?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e50-deep-reading/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
